title: "Resonatus Ontology: OWL 2 DL Model, SHACL Validation Profile, and Verification Artefacts"
abstract: >
  Resonatus Ontology v1.0.0 research artefact: an OWL 2 DL model of persistent causal trace
  processes, a SHACL validation profile, competency questions, worked examples, and reproducible
  offline formal-verification artefacts. Split licensing applies: the ontology, documentation,
  examples, and shapes are licensed CC BY 4.0; the executable validation code is licensed Apache-2.0.
  See LICENSE.md for the authoritative per-path licence mapping.
